      "writtenOn": "2022-01-18T11:21:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we cherry-pick the Soong change, we will be able to merge this CL into sc-mainline-prod, but it still won\u0027t change the device\u0027s behavior at all because this feature is for T and above. For this particular CL, the risk you described probably doesn\u0027t exist on S devices.\n\nHaving this CL and the checks on AOSP has values to us:\n1. Dogfooders can dogfood this change and report problems to us if any.\n2. Developers can be notified to ensure the jars dexopted when they add new standalone system server jars.",
      "parentUuid": "43653f60_bf095093",
      "range": {
