      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s impossible to get a change id that exists in sc-mainline-prod but does not exist in master, because master is a downstream branch of sc-mainline-prod. Even a DO NOT MERGE change will leave footage in downstream branchs. Therefore, the common practice that the mainline modularization team uses is to land a CL on master first, then cherry-pick it into aosp-master with a Merged-In tag that exists in both sc-mainline-prod and master.",
